    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "AI 工作流程效率（AI Workflow Efficiency）",
  "uid": "ai-workflow-efficiency",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "檢視重複驗證、有歸因的等待、重試與高耗時 workflow stage；只反映已送出的 ai_context evidence。"
}
